Statement:
\[
\sup_{q\in Q}\sum_{\theta\in F}\pi_\theta L_\theta(q)
=
\sum_{t=1}^T\int \max_{a\in G}
\sum_{\theta\in F}\pi_\theta f^\theta_{t,a}(h)\,d\lambda_t(h),
\]
where \(d\mu^\theta_{t,a}=f^\theta_{t,a}d\lambda_t\).
