\[
\sum_\theta\pi_\theta L_\theta(q)
=
\sum_t\int\sum_{a\in G}q_{t,a}(h)
\left(\sum_\theta\pi_\theta f^\theta_{t,a}(h)\right)d\lambda_t(h).
